1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,630
Right-click a tab, such as Summary, and undock it.

2
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:09,490
Summary now has a window of its own.

3
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:15,400
Undock a second panel, here Instruments.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,730
With two panels floating, a + appears in the title bar.

5
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:21,140
Pick a panel to bring it into this window as a tab.

6
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:25,830
Click the tabs to switch between the panels.

7
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:30,380
The arrow on a tab moves it out into a window of its own again.

8
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,940
The first button minimises a window to the taskbar.

9
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,490
The next makes it full size, and restores it again.

10
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:41,250
The X puts the panel back in the main window.

11
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:44,250
Both panels are back in their tabs.

